---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: EnvironmentalClaim[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for assembleSubmission. Build the required schedules, methodology notes, and narrative with consistent quantities and boundaries. Present gaps and restatements clearly, obtain responsible review, and preserve the exact submitted edition and subsequent corrections. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
